} 
```
Explanation: The error here is the "diagonal" argument passed as the gradient direction which our create-gradient mixin does not support. Our mixin only supports up, down, left, or right as the gradient direction hence it will activate the .error() function, displaying an error message instead of rendering a background gradient.

